{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123742","id":4609593711,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEsDRbw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123742","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123742.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123742.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123742","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123742/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123742/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123742/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f2f157c3cf1ad3db6ccd317ddfb444a4d51ee9ad","number":123742,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Update MIME type list to use IANA-registered names","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As of an hour before opening this PR, Godot's MIME types / media types are officially registered with IANA. This PR updates Godot's own files to use them. The new types are:\r\n\r\n- `application/vnd.godot.project.binary`\r\n- `application/vnd.godot.project.text`\r\n- `application/vnd.godot.resource.binary`\r\n- `application/vnd.godot.resource.text`\r\n- `model/vnd.godot.scene.binary`\r\n- `model/vnd.godot.scene.text`\r\n- `text/vnd.godot.gdscript`\r\n- `text/vnd.godot.gdshader`\r\n\r\nThese use the `vnd.godot` prefix reserved by IANA for the Godot Foundation, which replaces the `x-` application-specific prefix found in the old set of MIME types, which this PR is replacing:\r\n\r\n- `application/x-godot-project`\r\n- `application/x-godot-resource`\r\n- `application/x-godot-scene`\r\n- `application/x-godot-shader`\r\n- `application/x-gdscript`\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the new MIME types have these structural differences:\r\n\r\n- The `.binary` and `.text` versions of project, resource, and scene are split. This is due to IANA's requirements, I initially proposed to IANA to have just `application/vnd.godot.resource` etc, but they said different encodings need to have different MIME types.\r\n- The scene formats are placed under `model/`, better categorizing them with other similar file types like glTF.\r\n- The GDScript and GDShader formats are placed under `text/`, giving a better hint to text editors or text viewers that they can open the files, assuming such software makes judgements based on MIME type.\r\n\r\nThe `<icon name=\"x-godot-project\"/>` etc entries in the Linux XML file were left alone, so that icon themes keep working. If changing these is also desired, let me know and I can amend this PR.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAI usage disclaimer: Most of the macOS plist file changes are AI-generated, because I am not familiar with plist files.\r\n\r\nThe AI flagged an existing problem with `UTTypeIdentifier`, where Godot was using names like `public.tscn`. Apple states that applications should use domain-qualified names rather than `public.*` ones. Changes to these are included. The AI also confirmed that new `UTTypeIdentifier` entries are required to handle the split binary/text types.\r\n\r\nAside from these two aspects, the changes are very straightforward/mechanical/menial, I'm confident that I could produce near-byte-identical results by hand with these two facts in mind. Also, the plist files pass `plutil -lint`. Still, the macOS plist files should be reviewed by a macOS plist expert such as @bruvzg.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar